; Find the next object that a typed noun phrase can mean
;
; Walks the object table (#R$9B93) from the entry in IX and returns the id of
; the next record that qualifies, or $FF at the end of the table. A record
; qualifies when:
; .
; 1. its kind fits AllMode ($B710): 0 things (objects and dead characters), 1
; living characters (flag bit 6 set, bit 3 clear), ALL_MODE_ANY anything;
; .
; 2. its name phrase (+8, three word codes) matches the typed phrase (the
; match is #R$71F3, which compares word by word);
; .
; 3. unless AllActive ($B70F) is set, the actor can reach it (#R$9E34).
; .
; Start with IX = ObjectTable-3 ($C060); to get the next candidate call again with
; the IX returned. DE, HL and IY are kept.
; .
; HL Typed noun phrase (three word tokens)
; IX Entry before the first to examine (ObjectTable-3 to start)
; O:A Id of the object found, $FF when there are no more
; O:IX Its entry in the object table
@label=FindNextNamedObject
c$9DD9 PUSH BC       ;
 $9DDA PUSH DE       ;
 $9DDB PUSH IY       ;
 $9DDD LD IY,($B70C) ; the actor's record
 $9DE1 LD D,(IY+$10) ; D := the actor's location (not used again)
 $9DE4 LD A,($B710)  ; AllMode
 $9DE7 LD E,A        ;
@label=FindNextNamedObject_Next
*$9DE8 CALL $9B93    ;
 $9DEB JR Z,$9E1D    ; end of the table
@isub=LD A,ALL_MODE_ANY
 $9DED LD A,$02      ;
 $9DEF CP E          ;
 $9DF0 JR Z,$9E01    ; any kind
 $9DF2 LD A,(IY+$07) ;
 $9DF5 AND $48       ; character and not dead?
 $9DF7 CP $40        ;
 $9DF9 LD A,$00      ;
 $9DFB JR NZ,$9DFE   ;
 $9DFD INC A         ; 1 = living character
*$9DFE CP E          ;
 $9DFF JR NZ,$9DE8   ; the wrong kind
@isub=LD BC,REC_PHRASE_A
*$9E01 LD BC,$0008   ;
 $9E04 PUSH IY       ;
 $9E06 ADD IY,BC     ; its name phrase
 $9E08 CALL $71F3    ;
 $9E0B POP IY        ;
 $9E0D JR NZ,$9DE8   ; the phrase does not match
 $9E0F LD A,($B70F)  ; AllActive
 $9E12 AND A         ;
 $9E13 JR NZ,$9E1D   ; no reach test then
 $9E15 LD A,(IX+$00) ;
 $9E18 CALL $9E34    ;
 $9E1B JR Z,$9DE8    ; out of reach
*$9E1D LD A,(IX+$00) ;
 $9E20 POP IY        ;
 $9E22 POP DE        ;
 $9E23 POP BC        ;
 $9E24 RET           ;
